.middle-box.text-center.animated.fadeInDown
  %h1 403
  %h3.font-bold Access forbidden
  .error-desc
    Sorry, but you are not allowed to access this path. Try checking the URL for error, then hit the refresh button on your browser or try found something else in our app.
    %br/
    You can go back to main page:
    %br/
    = link_to root_path do
      %span.btn.btn-primary.m-t
        Mainpage
